369
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:57,080
Then the slope is negative for a little

370
00:13:57,080 --> 00:13:59,560
while, while the sine is decreasing,

371
00:13:59,560 --> 00:14:01,560
before coming back up to zero as the

372
00:14:01,560 --> 00:14:04,480
sine graph levels out.

373
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,720
And as you continue thinking this

374
00:14:05,720 --> 00:14:07,360
through and drawing it out, if you're

375
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,800
familiar with the graph of trig

376
00:14:08,800 --> 00:14:10,800
functions, you might guess that this

377
00:14:10,800 --> 00:14:12,840
derivative graph should be exactly

378
00:14:12,840 --> 00:14:15,200
cosine of theta, since all the peaks and

379
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,960
