380
00:14:16,960 --> 00:14:18,320
peaks and valleys for the cosine

381
00:14:18,320 --> 00:14:20,040
function should be.

382
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:22,200
And spoiler alert, the derivative is in

383
00:14:22,200 --> 00:14:24,240
fact the cosine of theta.

384
00:14:24,240 --> 00:14:25,680
But aren't you a little curious about

385
00:14:25,680 --> 00:14:28,200
why it's precisely cosine of theta? I

386
00:14:28,200 --> 00:14:29,400
mean, you could have all sorts of

387
00:14:29,400 --> 00:14:31,040
