397
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:49,360
function actually represents, rather

398
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,600
than looking at the graph of the

399
00:14:50,600 --> 00:14:52,240
function.

400
00:14:52,240 --> 00:14:53,760
So, think back to that walk around the

401
00:14:53,760 --> 00:14:55,080
unit circle.

402
00:14:55,080 --> 00:14:56,720
Having traversed an arc with length

403
00:14:56,720 --> 00:14:58,720
theta, and thinking about sin of theta

404
00:14:58,720 --> 00:15:01,560
as the height of that point.

405
00:15:01,560 --> 00:15:03,200
Now, zoom in to that point on the

406
00:15:03,200 --> 00:15:06,000
circle, and consider a slight nudge of d

407
00:15:06,000 --> 00:15:08,440
theta along their circumference, a tiny

408
00:15:08,440 --> 00:15:10,200
step in your walk around the unit

409
00:15:10,200 --> 00:15:11,600
circle.

410
00:15:11,600 --> 00:15:13,760
How much does that tiny step change the

411
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,360
