415
00:15:21,480 --> 00:15:23,480
Well, zoomed in close enough, the circle

416
00:15:23,480 --> 00:15:25,040
basically looks like a straight line in

417
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:26,760
this neighborhood. So, let's go ahead

418
00:15:26,760 --> 00:15:28,920
and think of this right triangle, where

419
00:15:28,920 --> 00:15:31,000
